    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Thirty-three year old Sanaullah, from a village in Nawabshah, was brought to the University Hospital in a serious condition. Feeble, extremely malnourished and weighing only 35.5 kilograms, he could barely lift his head. On the very first day at the hospital, the treating doctor walked up to his bed and declared, \"Only a committed dietician can save this patient.\"",
